@* A button that stays pressed, and a real checkbox underneath so it posts. role="button"
   with aria-pressed is what a screen reader needs: a bare checkbox that looks like a button
   would be described wrongly. *@
<Toggle Name="bold" Checked><Icon Name="pencil" /></Toggle>
<Toggle Name="italic">Italic</Toggle>
<Toggle Name="disabled" Disabled>Disabled</Toggle>
